  "description": "Hand-assembled to order at the Fly warehouse and fully customizable following these steps:\n\n1. Select the bike you want using the options available on the website.\n2. Proceed with the order confirmation.\n3. For any specific part change, just write in the comments the part you’d like to replace.\n4. Confirm your order\n\n- Parts with higher price: 30% discount to the individual price difference.\n- Upcharge Payment: Once the order is confirmed, we´ll send you a link to proceed.\n- If the chosen part is not available, we´ll inform you the delivery info.\n- No refunds are issued for parts of lower value.\n\n• The option without brakes does not include any brake hardware.\n• Easy Assembly with our 100% plastic-free recyclable packaging.\n• LHD (Left-Hand Drive) and RHD (Right-Hand Drive):\nWhere the drivetrain is located to protect the chain/sprocket when you grind.\n\nThe new ELECTRON BMX has been designed to let every rider rank the highest quality ride without breaking the bank. Cr-Mo material in stress points powers its endurance.\n\nDue to possible supply-chain issues or shipping delays specs are subject to change without notice. The swap part will always be similar model with the same or even higher quality.",
